From 849a84ee6d8ae73820343cfc0bd98d7e57dd74c7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Su-Qingmu <Su-Qingu@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 22:06:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(i18n): translate menu.hpp UI strings from English to
 Chinese
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- 200+ UI labels, status messages, key names, and section headers
  translated to Simplified Chinese.
- 4 fixed strings kept in English by intent: 'CS2 External ESP v2.0',
  'github.com/tiansongyu/cs2_cheat', technical placeholder URLs, and
  ImGuiColorEditFlags_* enum values.
- Key names translated: mouse -> 鼠标, function keys F1-F12 unchanged,
  digit/letter keys unchanged, arrows translated (左/右/上/下), numpad
  translated to 数字N, special keys (回车/退格/Esc/空格/...) translated.
- Preserved all C++ identifiers (espWeapon, espDistance, etc.),
  comments, and code structure.
